{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05117","headline":"塞北二首 一 · 沈佺期","name":"塞北二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虏障天骄起，秦城地脉分。\n柏坛飞五将，梅吹动三军。\n锋刃奔涛色，旌旗焰火文。\n朔风吹汗漫，飘砾洒轒輼。\n海气如秋雨，边烽似夏云。\n二庭无岁月，百战有功勳。\n形影随鱼贯，音书在雁羣。\n归来拜天子，凯乐助南薰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}